Most Asked Interview Questions
1. Why Terraform in Snowflake?

Automates creation of databases, schemas, warehouses, roles, and grants.

2. What is DCM?

Managing database changes through version-controlled migration scripts.

3. Why Schemachange?

Tracks and deploys Snowflake schema changes in sequence.

4. What is dbt?

A SQL-based transformation framework used on top of Snowflake.

5. Difference between Terraform and dbt?
Terraform	dbtCreates Infrastructure	Transforms Data
Database	Tables/Data
Warehouse	Models
Roles	SQL Logic
6. What is Incremental Model?

Processes only new or changed records instead of full load.

7. What are dbt tests?
unique
not_null
accepted_values
relationships
8. What is lineage?

Tracking data flow from source to target through all transformations.

Easy Memory Trick
Plain Text
Terraform = Build House
DCM = Track House Changes
dbt = Arrange Furniture Inside House

This simple analogy is very effective in interviews and helps explain the complete Snowflake IaC + DCM + dbt ecosystem.